                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/1073: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bailly-Blanchard</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-11T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                                1921—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:40
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>11. Department’s 7, January 25th, 7 p.m. Customs receipts for January amount to
                    $272,000.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
